  {
   "eyebrow": "Contacts With the President, VP & Cabinet",
   "headline": "No FARA contacts with the President, Vice President or cabinet; two LDA filings name the President",
   "paragraphs": [
    "No FARA filings were queued for review today. Two third-quarter LDA reports reference the President."
   ],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      "<strong>National Roofing Contractors Association</strong> (in-house filing): lists the President among the entities lobbied and names Donald Trump. Lobbying topics include the Ratepayer Protection Act (H.R. 9340), the Corporate Transparency Act, EPA risk evaluations under TSCA, and immigration legislation and President Trump's executive actions on immigration. <a href=\"https://lda.gov/filings/public/filing/e85dc5c4-00c9-4865-bb91-8b663ce44896/print/\">Filing</a>.",
      "<strong>National Affordable Housing Management Association</strong> (in-house filing): names Donald Trump in the filing text. The lobbying description shown covers the Workforce Housing Tax Credit Act (H.R. 8626) and the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (Public Law 119-21). <a href=\"https://lda.gov/filings/public/filing/987a797f-7523-4074-b3bf-7e7f5972985b/print/\">Filing</a>."
     ]
    }
   ],
