  {
   "eyebrow": "Personal Financial Disclosures & Stock Trades",
   "headline": "Four House filings: three trade reports led by Cisneros's 57 transactions",
   "paragraphs": [
    "Four House filings were new today and no Senate filings. Three are periodic transaction reports and one is an amendment. None of the trades in the input is marked late."
   ],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      "<strong>Rep. Gilbert Cisneros</strong> (D-CA31), periodic transaction report filed October 12, 57 transactions: 29 purchases, 10 sales, 17 partial sales and one exchange (<strong>Thermon Group Holdings</strong>, $15,001 to $50,000). The three largest lines are municipal bond trades of $250,001 to $500,000. Equity trades are mostly $1,001 to $15,000, with several $15,001 to $50,000 trades in <strong>ITT</strong>, <strong>MACOM Technology Solutions</strong>, <strong>RBC Bearings</strong>, <strong>Revvity</strong>, <strong>ON Semiconductor</strong>, <strong>NXP Semiconductors</strong> and <strong>Benchmark Electronics</strong>. <a href=\"https://disclosures-clerk.house.gov/public_disc/ptr-pdfs/2026/20035622.pdf\">Filing</a>.",
      "<strong>Rep. Rick Larsen</strong> (D-WA02), periodic transaction report filed October 12, 4 trades, all dated October 8 and all $1,001 to $15,000: purchases of <strong>Analog Devices</strong> and <strong>Williams-Sonoma</strong>; sales of <strong>FedEx</strong> and <strong>Home Depot</strong>. <a href=\"https://disclosures-clerk.house.gov/public_disc/ptr-pdfs/2026/20035635.pdf\">Filing</a>.",
      "<strong>Rep. Lisa McClain</strong> (R-MI09), periodic transaction report filed October 12, 9 trades dated September 14 to 30, all marked as spouse-owned: 8 purchases and one partial sale of <strong>Seagate Technology</strong>. The largest, $15,001 to $50,000, are <strong>CACI International</strong>, <strong>Olin</strong>, <strong>Transocean</strong> and the Seagate sale. Two <strong>ImmunityBio</strong> purchases (September 28 and 30) are in the $1,001 to $15,000 range. <a href=\"https://disclosures-clerk.house.gov/public_disc/ptr-pdfs/2026/20035585.pdf\">Filing</a>.",
      "<strong>Paul Barringer</strong> (NC13), amendment to a financial disclosure filed October 13. <a href=\"https://disclosures-clerk.house.gov/public_disc/financial-pdfs/2026/10083057.pdf\">Filing</a>."
     ]
    },
